msgctxt "search2:search2_22C13D51_DBA6_454B_A907_82B7C8844581"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫When I "
"learned my father Antonin had passed, I wrote two letters—⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫one to my brother, "
"and one to my mother."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Quando "
"venni a sapere che mio padre Antonin era deceduto,⟪k:16⟫scrissi due lettere—⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫una a mio "
"fratello, e una a mia madre."

#: search2:search2_09F798CD_19DD_43E8_B229_4FF82C14F5C9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb5aeaf77d320f1cf711a31d631367394f476887529dca9d69eedb93f94d3c16
